        "edge_connectivity.descr": "<xdoc><p>Specifies the edge connectivity type that will be assigned to the asset type.</p><ul><li><span title=\"ANY_VERTEX\">Any vertex</span>—Features will connect anywhere along the edge including end vertices.</li><li><span title=\"END_VERTEX\">End vertex</span>—Features will only connect to the end vertex of an edge.</li></ul></xdoc>",
