        "out_utility_network.title": "Updated Utility Network",
        "summary": "<xdoc><p>Defines how features will connect to a line or edge object of a given asset type.</p><p>Connectivity may be established with lines and edge objects at two locations: an endpoint and a midspan vertex. Each asset type in the domain network is set with a default edge connectivity setting.</p></xdoc>",
